                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L_\infty
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1204.4999"} arXiv:1204.4999
            %h3#ReferencesInPhysics
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi L
                      %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L_\infty
              \-algebras in physics
            %p
              The following lists, mainly in chronological order of their discovery,
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/L-%E2%88%9E+algebra"} L-∞ algebra
              structures appearing in
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/physics"} physics
