                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+category+theory+and+physics"} higher category theory and physics
            %h4#in_supergravity_and_higher_spin_theory In supergravity and higher spin theory
            %p
              Implicitly, in their equivalent
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/formal+dual"} formal dual
              guise of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chevalley-Eilenberg+algebras"} Chevalley-Eilenberg algebras
              (see
              = succeed ")," do
                %a{:href => "#ReformulationInTermsOfSemifreeDGAlgebra"} above
              = succeed "-algebras" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
